<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.792 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.792 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS500 million   6.792	 6.77-6.80   6.780 (Aug 28)</p>
<p>(RBA take-up A$500 million, pct allotted at top 40)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   6.767	 6.74-6.78   6.730 (Aug 28)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 57)</p>
<p>Note:- There was no T-note tender held last week.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
